WEBVTT

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:01.780
Translation by Yun

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.260
Master!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:23.720
Welcome Home!

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.620
W...What a scary aura...

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.320
It's this damn kid, huh...

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.179
I say kid...

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.640
You got a lot of guts...

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.359
Keep those guys.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:42.680
Oh! I'm safe!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.240
Beat him up.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:49.480
NOT MY FACE...

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:51.880
Haoyi!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:52.720
Dad!

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:54.680
Haoyi, He's innocent!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:55.360
Look!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.720
This is the report from Hospital!

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.200
Stop.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:02:59.920
Interesting.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.280
Student.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.200
What sort of play is this.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.440
If I had not say it like that...

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.220
Will you still come back to see your Daughter?

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.760
Or have you forgotten about her!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.620
Haoyi...

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.880
Your daughter needs...

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.340
You don't even know...

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.359
Yes.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.300
You did give her a luxury house.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.780
A group of bodyguards and a house keeper...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.400
You always make sure she never will go hungry...

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.480
But...

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.360
Is this really what she wants?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.020
What she wants is-

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.320
Her family's warm-

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.799
Is your affection towards her!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.959
Haoyi...

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:46.799
D-damn kid...

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.440
Do you know what's love?!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.940
You think these money came flying from the wind?!

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.280
Uncle Xia...

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:55.679
Stop torturing your own family..

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.200
Look at this.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:58.600
Thi-

00:03:59.300 --> 00:03:59.920
This is-

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.720
I finally realized...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.799
Her most happiness time...

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.400
Is with you-

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.940
Happily enjoying a meal...

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.500
All she ever wanted was-

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.000
For you to be with her...

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.480
From a outsider view, this may not be a satisfying happiness...

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:16.940
But...

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.000
It was her biggest dream...

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:25.760
Uncle Xia.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:27.420
Think about it.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.520
This is so touching...

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.020
Young Man, Well said...

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:35.159
Then...

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.120
I'll be leaving.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.360
RUN!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.600
T-they won't be chasing this far I hope...

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:57.580
Haoyi.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.600
You can run that fast?!

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:02.760
Ah no~

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.000
This is just my house's backdoor.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.680
Your house is too big...

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.000
Thank you.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.580
What happen...

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.800
Disappeared...

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:24.919
Not disappear.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.580
Is the magic has been lifted.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.920
Congratulation on granting her wish.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.000
Zi Tong

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.260
Today Dady will eat with you.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.140
But thinking about it.

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:41.599
I never expect you to be that dedicated.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:42.960
Dedicated?

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:44.100
Oh please.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.480
I hate troublesome.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.340
Since the problem has been solved.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.220
Then, I'll get going.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.479
Just when I thought my life is getting a make over-

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.320
After being cling on by Xiao Hua.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.000
And within two days it's over.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:56.280
Well...

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.320
At least I don't have to...

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.400
See her sad anymore...

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.479
What a serious Young Man...

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.039
God damn...

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.040
They really got me good...

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.200
What the hell?

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.060
Jiang Haoyi, Lin Yuan's husband, His Son and Daughter  are still waiting for him at home. If anyone has seen him, Please contact the following number.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:25.659
What the?!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.560
What's happening?!

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.680
This never ends...

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.680
The Legendary call Harem...

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:37.840
Was suppose to be eternal happiness...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.440
When it comes to me is...

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.280
Anyways! I mustn't get caught!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.000
Better hide first...

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.400
Found.Ya~

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.240
Lucky I didn't get spotted...

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.780
Escaped a crisis...

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:17.940
Eh?

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.560
This smell.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:20.600
It's familiar.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.240
Haoyi.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:25.160
Can you, walk with me tomorrow?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:26.740
WHAT?!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.619
Y-you can still remember me...?

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:34.040
How can I not remember...

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.760
Thank you for everything...

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.960
T-t-t-t-this...-

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.280
MEI TATA!!!

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.260
ZA WARUDOU!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.840
TOKI WO TOMARE!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.520
Yes?

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.160
What were you doing?!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.000
Didn't you said the magic is lifted?!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:54.960
You were leaving in a hurry.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.060
So I forgot to tell you.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.080
Once the love magic is complete.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.940
The false memory will be wiped of course.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.560
But...

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:03.480
But...?

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:06.760
But normal memory cannot be wiped.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.719
What happen during these two days.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:10.940
She can never forget.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.080
That means-

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.440
Whatever feeling she has for you now...

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.440
Came from her heart.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.580
What a cop out!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.080
I don't care!

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.280
You better-

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.359
Haoyi.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:29.000
Why did you say something Mei...

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.179
I said no problem...
TL Note: 梅/Mei 没/Mei

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.360
Really?

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:35.479
Then that's set.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.520
Why didn't you invite me to that date of yours.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.280
Say.

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:55.640
At which step are you two at now...

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.160
Misunderstand...

00:08:59.160 --> 00:08:59.680
Xueli.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.140
You misunderstood!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.200
Misunderstand...

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.760
Then let me...

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.660
"Clear" the Misunderstanding.

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.719
WOW!

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.620
This is so bold!

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.800
Do you understand now?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.200
Jiang Haoyi-

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.480
He's mine.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.140
Ohnoohno...

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.880
I'mgoingtogetrape...

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.300
Helpmeahhh...

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:32.680
Xueli!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.060
Stop what you're doing.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:35.720
Mom!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.079
Why are you here.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.780
You flew all the way from America-

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:40.020
Just for this damn kid?

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:40.920
Auntie.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:41.920
Glad you're here.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.740
Long time no see and you've gotten prettier-

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:44.800
Shut up.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.420
You better go back right now!

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:48.380
No way.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.439
No one can stop me from being with Haoyi.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.880
I will never agree with you two dating.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.380
You better give up!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.439
Instant Kill!

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.600
Old but still good!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:13.860
Come in.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.600
Carry her out.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:16.660
Yes! Boss!

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:22.980
Auntie.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.040
I think you should take Xueli back to America.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.500
Inviting a God and telling a God leave is a different thing.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.040
Haoyi.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:31.599
I suggest you go buy a Insurance.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:33.000
It's over...

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.680
I'm really dead...

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:35.880
I'm afraid...

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.680
My life is really on the line...

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:43.980
HI YOUR HEAD!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.800
DON'T KEEP ALWAYS APPEARING AT MY SIDE!

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.040
I BEG OF YOU!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.560
YOU LOOK CUTE!

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.560
AND YOU'RE A GODDESS!

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:52.520
BUT YOU WANT TO PLAY GHOST!

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:53.780
CAN'T YOU PLAY SOME OTHER STUFF?!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.140
Haoyi he...

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:56.740
What's wrong with him...

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.560
Just now that girl, she ate the chocolate too?

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.840
She's like that all the time...

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.580
The world most scariest childhood friend...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.080
From what I heard from my parents...

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:11.480
We've been playing together ever since we were a baby...

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.640
And then, we went to primary school, secondary school...

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:18.420
Thinking about it, it's just depressing...

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:20.740
Who's behind me!

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.360
It's you...

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:30.180
Aiya-

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.760
I got spotted...

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.260
I was hiding so well...

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.040
You were pretty oblivious...

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.199
I...

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.960
Shouldn't bother him...

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.500
They're childhood friend after all...

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:46.460
I-

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.160
I'm here to say-

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:49.080
Tomorrow...

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.540
Forget about it...

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.880
You said tomorrow huh...

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.260
I remember now.

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:55.160
I forgot ask you-

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.560
About the location and time.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:57.699
Sorry about that.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.980
I'm not the kind of person who pay attention to these kind of details.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.300
Let me know when you have confirmed.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.400
Oho~ Looks like you really like her after all~~~

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:12.900
WHAT!

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:15.040
IT WAS YOU WHO CREATED THIS MESS!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.280
Don't follow me anymore!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:18.079
Please!

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.560
She really didn't follow me.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:25.900
I manage to shake her off?

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.400
Jiang Haoyi!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.480
We're break up!

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:49.719
Translation by Yun.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:04.220
Timing by Yun.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:20.880
Edited by Yun.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:33.080
Yareyaredaze. You guys should just learn Chinese and watch it.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:42.260
Well, hope you guys enjoyed this episode, Cheers to me.
